      "act": "COLD OPEN",
      "lane": "TERMINAL",
      "narration_text": "This is Liam, in for Bear. I don't write code, and I'm about to build something anyway. That's what vibecoding is: you describe the thing, Claude Code writes it, you decide whether it's right. An empty folder, one file in it, and one paragraph — every constraint I care about, up front. Watch what it does first.",
