      "beat_id": "BIDEA",
      "act": "THE IDEA",
      "lane": "IDEA",
      "narration_text": "Here's the idea of this film. Vibecoding means you describe a tool in plain words, Claude Code writes it, and you decide whether it's right — not by trusting it, by reading it. I'll build a reading log I'd actually use, and I'll show you the two things it added that I never asked for, and the one thing it wrote outside my folder.",
