      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Five words before we start. Vibecoding: you describe the tool in plain words, Claude writes the code, you judge it. Local storage: the browser's own small store — the page keeps your data with no server. Tool call: Claude asking for permission to read, write, or run something. Diff: the exact lines removed, in red, and added, in green — nothing else. And git diff stat: the change tracker's one-line answer — which files, how many lines.",
